# Token saver, this project

General rules: the user rule `~/.cursor/rules/token-saver.mdc` (source `03-Knowledge/AI-RULES.md` in the vault `~/Obsidian/AI-Memory`). Where it is not loaded: targeted reads, filtered output, diff-only edits.

- Summaries: `<command> 2>&1 | summarize-to-obsidian -p AmoreHireMePls -t <topic>`; for a diff add `-k diff`. A diff summary is a record, not a review.
- Vault notes about this project carry field names and counts only, never candidate data.
- The `obsidian` MCP server is for vault search. Read and edit notes by path.
- Tier 3 here also covers anything that touches authorization. Formatting is `ruff format`, no model.
